ntity\"):\n                errors.append(f\"inventory entry for {design_id} needs a planned_quantity\")\n            if not isinstance(entry.get(\"verification\"), str) or not entry[\"verification\"]:\n                errors.append(f\"inventory entry for {design_id} needs verification\")\n            inventory_by_design.setdefault(design_id, []).append(entry)\n        for unit_id in sorted(unit_ids):\n            if not inventory_by_design.get(unit_id):\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/INITIAL.md:3:This file is the source of truth for the document-producing collection. Later\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/05-delivery-map.md:7:not claims that code already exists. Complete the gated G design collection\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0001.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0002.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0003.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0004.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0005.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GB0001.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GB0002.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GB0003.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GC0001.md\nprojects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GD0001.md\n\ncodex\n{\"status\":\"pass\",\"summary\":\"The existing F005 work is present in `football-trivia-e2e`; the dispatcher is intentionally pending because later G/GB/GC/GQ tasks complete the design gate. I\u2019m checking only static planning consistency.\",\"changed_files\":[],\"test_result\":\"\",\"evidence\":{\"agent_log\":\"\",\"adapter_log\":\"\",\"test_log\":\"\",\"browser_log\":\"\",\"screenshots\":[]},\"acceptance_results\":[],\"documentation\":{\"reviewed_files\":[],\"updated_files\":[],\"summary\":\"\"},\"known_limitations\":[],\"browser_coverage\":\"\",\"recommended_next_step\":\"complete\"}\nexec\n/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 -m json.tool projects/football-trivia-e2e/